From: schoeremy <jeremyfroeb2007@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:07:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 49/61] nxhost: ldn:u local wireless service that finds nobody

ldn:u was a stub that returned no session object, so nn::ldn::Initialize
dereferenced null when Splatoon 3 entered the Inkcade. The new service
initializes, scans an empty air, fails Connect and lets the game open an
access point whose network only holds this console.

